kmap 1
id ee-dvorak
layout ee
variant dvorak
name Estonian (Dvorak)
level3 ralt
key TLDE ` ~ dead_grave dead_tilde
key AE01 1 !
key AE02 2 @
key AE03 3 '#' £
key AE04 4 $ § ¤
key AE05 5 % €
key AE06 6 ^ dead_circumflex dead_circumflex
key AE07 7 &
key AE08 8 * ½
key AE09 9 ( dead_grave dead_breve
key AE10 0 )
key AE11 [ {
key AE12 ] } dead_tilde
key AD01 '''' " dead_acute dead_diaeresis
key AD02 , < dead_cedilla dead_caron
key AD03 . > dead_abovedot ·
key AD04 p P caps
key AD05 y Y caps
key AD06 f F caps
key AD07 g G caps
key AD08 c C caps
key AD09 r R caps
key AD10 l L caps
key AD11 / ?
key AD12 = +
key BKSL \ |
key AC01 a A ä Ä caps
key AC02 o O õ Õ caps
key AC03 e E ö Ö caps
key AC04 u U ü Ü caps
key AC05 i I caps
key AC06 d D caps
key AC07 h H caps
key AC08 t T caps
key AC09 n N caps
key AC10 s S š Š caps
key AC11 - _
key LSGT < > | ¦
key AB01 ; : dead_ogonek dead_doubleacute
key AB02 q Q caps
key AB03 j J caps
key AB04 k K caps
key AB05 x X caps
key AB06 b B caps
key AB07 m M caps
key AB08 w W caps
key AB09 v V caps
key AB10 z Z ž Ž caps
key SPCE space
key KPDL KP_Delete KP_Separator
